  'Open or create a movie first, then take the tour.': "请先打开或创建影片,然后开始导览。", 'Take the Tour': "开始导览", 'Reset Examples?': "重置示例?",
  'The example movies are written again as they came. Changes you made to them are replaced.': "示例影片将按原样重新写入。您对它们所做的更改将被替换。",
  'The examples were reset, except the one that is open. Close it and reset again to rebuild it.': "示例已重置,但已打开的除外。请关闭它并再次重置以重建。",
