  'Remove from stack': "从堆叠中移除", '1 selected': "已选 1 项", 'Delete stack': "删除堆叠", 'Done selecting': "完成选择", 'Close the movie before renaming it.': "重命名前请先关闭影片。",
  'Rename movie': "重命名影片", 'Rename stack': "重命名堆叠", 'Movie duplicated.': "影片已复制。", 'Motion paths, the Graph, bones and a friendlier start': "运动路径、曲线图、骨骼和更友好的开始",
  'Three small example movies wait in your Theater, and a short tour points out the Stage, the Timeline, the modes and the Create menu. Both can be brought back from Help.': "剧场中有三部小型示例影片,简短导览会介绍舞台、时间轴、模式和“创建”菜单。两者都可从帮助中重新调出。",
  'Preview in the Theater': "在剧场中预览", 'Rest the pointer on a movie in the Theater to see it move. Sharing a movie asks whether to keep its full undo history or to make the file smaller.': "将指针停在剧场中的影片上即可看到它运动。分享影片时会询问是保留完整撤销历史还是缩小文件。",
  'Graph editor and custom eases': "曲线图编辑器与自定义缓动", 'Draw your own easing curves with Bezier handles, with overshoot, and reverse a span with one click.': "用贝塞尔手柄绘制自己的缓动曲线,支持过冲,并可一键反转一段。",
  'Motion paths, pivots and parenting': "运动路径、轴心与父子关系", 'Bend the path a Move takes with handles on the Stage, turn things around a pivot you place, and make one block follow another.': "用舞台上的手柄弯曲移动路径,围绕您放置的轴心旋转物体,并让一个区块跟随另一个。",
  'Camera, bones and lip-sync': "摄像机、骨骼与口型同步", 'Key a movie camera, rig a drawing with bones, and have mouth shapes follow a voice track.': "为电影摄像机设置关键帧,为绘图装配骨骼,并让口型跟随语音轨道。",
  'Background color, transparency, the Backstage, the timecode and Onion skins in one panel, also on the Stage right-click menu.': "背景颜色、透明度、后台、时间码和洋葱皮集中在一个面板中,也可在舞台右键菜单中使用。",
  'Keyboard Shortcuts editor': "键盘快捷键编辑器", 'Every command with its keys. Change them, and conflicts are moved with a message.': "每条命令及其按键。可随意更改,冲突会带提示地处理。",
  'Brush library and blend modes': "画笔库与混合模式", '165 original brushes in 19 sets, import of brush files, and 25 blend modes with a true pass-through.': "19 组共 165 支原创画笔、画笔文件导入,以及 25 种带真正穿透的混合模式。",
  'Theater management': "剧场管理", 'Select several movies, rename, duplicate, stack movies into folders and use the right-click menu.': "选择多部影片,重命名、复制、堆叠成文件夹,并使用右键菜单。",
  'Round trips': "往返", 'Send the current frame to the form image editor and the whole movie to the form effects editor, and bring them back.': "将当前帧发送到 form 图像编辑器,将整部影片发送到 form 效果编辑器,再带回来。",
  'Groups, masks, Warp and a faster Stage': "分组、蒙版、Warp 与更快的舞台", 'Layer groups and masks': "图层组与蒙版",
  'Group Drawing layers, give them opacity and blend modes, and paint masks that hide without erasing.': "为绘图图层分组,设置不透明度和混合模式,并绘制只隐藏而不擦除的蒙版。",
  'Flipbook row masks and mini preview': "翻页动画行蒙版与迷你预览", 'Rows can cut the row below them, and a small preview loops beside the strip at the movie rate.': "行可以裁切其下方的行,小预览会以影片帧率在条带旁循环播放。",
  'Warp and Distort keys': "Warp 与 Distort 关键帧", 'Bend a block with a mesh or four corners and key the bend over time.': "用网格或四个角点弯曲区块,并为弯曲设置随时间变化的关键帧。",
  'Loop the visible region': "循环可见区域", 'Play only the part of the Timeline you can see, with sound restarting at its start.': "只播放时间轴上可见的部分,声音从起点重新开始。",
  'The Stage and exports draw on the graphics card when it matches the processor path. It is on by default and can be turned off in Preferences.': "当显卡结果与处理器一致时,舞台和导出将在显卡上绘制。默认开启,可在偏好设置中关闭。",
  'More export formats, recovery and 30 languages': "更多导出格式、恢复功能和 30 种语言", 'ProRes and HEVC export': "ProRes 与 HEVC 导出",
  'Export ProRes 422 HQ, ProRes 4444 with transparency and HEVC through the ffmpeg you have installed.': "通过您已安装的 ffmpeg 导出 ProRes 422 HQ、带透明度的 ProRes 4444 和 HEVC。", 'Deleted movies and exports stay for 30 days and can be restored.': "已删除的影片和导出文件保留 30 天,可恢复。", 'Crash recovery': "崩溃恢复",
  'If the window closes by accident, the next start offers to bring your movie back.': "如果窗口意外关闭,下次启动时会提示找回您的影片。", 'Thirty languages': "三十种语言",
  'The whole interface in 30 languages, switched live in Preferences.': "整个界面支持 30 种语言,可在偏好设置中即时切换。", 'The Manual': "手册", 'A searchable manual inside the app. Press F1.': "应用内可搜索的手册。按 F1。",
  'Backstage Visibility': "后台可见性", 'Drag to move, double-click to dock': "拖动移动,双击停靠", 'Delete selected layers': "删除所选图层", 'Group selected layers': "为所选图层分组",
