  '15 font families': "15 个字体系列", 'Fifteen built-in font families, including Arabic, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Thai and Devanagari.': "内置十五个字体系列，包括阿拉伯文、中文、日文、韩文、泰文和天城文。", 'Video with transparency': "带透明度的视频", 'Video that has transparency now keeps it on the Stage instead of showing black.': "带透明度的视频现在会在舞台上保留透明，而不是显示为黑色。",
  'HEIC pictures': "HEIC 图片", 'HEIC photos open through the engine when you have ffmpeg 7.1 or newer.': "有 ffmpeg 7.1 或更高版本时，HEIC 照片可通过引擎打开。", 'Push, extend and contract content': "推移、延长和缩短内容", 'Move what is inside a block by a frame, stretch it longer or shorter, and flip the order of its content.': "将块内的内容移动一帧，拉长或缩短，并反转其内容顺序。",
  'Loop range and pen play': "循环范围与笔播放", 'Set a loop range to repeat a part of the movie, and press the pen button to play. A four-finger tap previews the movie.': "设置循环范围以重复影片的一部分，按笔按钮即可播放。四指轻点可预览影片。", 'Bring any picture, video or sound in from the Create menu with Insert a file.': "通过创建菜单中的插入文件，导入任何图片、视频或声音。", 'Find movies that were left behind after a crash or a moved folder and bring them back.': "找出崩溃或文件夹被移动后遗留的影片，并将它们找回。",
  'Safer engine': "更安全的引擎", 'The engine now checks the host and origin of every request, and old movie files load cleanly.': "引擎现在会检查每个请求的主机和来源，旧的影片文件也能顺利载入。", 'Text, onboarding, export and import formats': "文字、新手引导、导出和导入格式", 'Text formatting': "文字格式", 'Style text on the Stage and edit it in place.': "在舞台上设置文字样式，并就地编辑。",
  'Examples, tour and What\'s New': "示例、导览和新功能", 'Three example movies, a short tour, this page and an About window help you get started.': "三部示例影片、简短导览、本页和关于窗口帮助你上手。", 'More ways to export': "更多导出方式", 'A preview window, H.264, HEVC, ProRes and VP9 video as .mp4, .mov or .webm, GIF presets and picture frames in PNG, JPG, TIFF, TGA, BMP and WebP.': "预览窗口、以 .mp4、.mov 或 .webm 导出 H.264、HEVC、ProRes 和 VP9 视频、GIF 预设，以及 PNG、JPG、TIFF、TGA、BMP 和 WebP 图片帧。",
  'More ways to import': "更多导入方式", 'Open TGA pictures and layered PSD, ORA, KRA and PDN files as Drawings; ProRes video and AIFF, CAF and AC-3 sound are converted by the engine.': "将 TGA 图片和带图层的 PSD、ORA、KRA、PDN 文件作为绘图打开；ProRes 视频和 AIFF、CAF、AC-3 声音由引擎转换。", 'A canvas for each Drawing': "每个绘图都有自己的画布", 'Every Drawing or Flipbook can have a canvas size of its own.': "每个绘图或翻页动画都可以有独立的画布尺寸。",
  'Touch and pen gestures': "触控和笔手势", 'Multi-finger taps and pinches work on the Stage and in Draw & Paint.': "多指轻点和捏合在舞台和绘制与上色中都可使用。", 'A library folder': "库文件夹", 'Choose where your movies are kept, and share a movie with or without its history.': "选择影片的存放位置，并可带历史记录或不带历史记录分享影片。",
  'frame {n} of {m}': "第 {n} 帧，共 {m} 帧", 'There is no room after the end of the movie.': "影片结尾之后没有空间了。",
  'Convert Layers to Tracks': "将图层转换为轨道", 'Copy to Folder': "复制到文件夹", 'Copied to': "已复制到", 'Movie file downloaded.': "影片文件已下载。", '{n} movie files downloaded.': "已下载 {n} 个影片文件。", 'Filters need a normal blend. A Passthrough group has no picture of its own.': "滤镜需要正常混合模式。穿透组没有自己的画面。", 'Use Normal': "使用正常", 'Primary (the left half is the previous color: click to go back)': "前景色（左半部分是上一个颜色：点击可返回）", 'Sample all layers': "对所有图层取样", 'Smooth': "平滑", 'Resample quality': "重新采样质量", 'Secondary color: click to pick it, click again to go back': "背景色：点击选取，再次点击返回", 'Edit the secondary color': "编辑背景色",
  'Sketching': "素描", 'Airbrushing': "喷枪", 'Textures': "纹理", 'Charcoals': "炭笔", 'Spraypaints': "喷漆", 'Materials': "材质", 'Untitled': "未命名", 'Got it': "知道了", 'Multi-select with finger': "用手指多选", 'Show tips': "显示提示", 'Drag to scale time. Drag the Playhead, or hold Shift, to scrub.': "拖动可缩放时间。拖动播放头，或按住 Shift，可进行拖曳浏览。",
  'Tip: select a block, press the red record disc on the Playhead, then drag it on the Stage. The drag is recorded as motion.': "提示：选择一个块，按下播放头上的红色录制圆盘，然后在舞台上拖动它。拖动会被录制为运动。", 'Tip: move the Playhead and change a value to set a keyframe there. Drag a key along its lane to retime it.': "提示：移动播放头并更改数值即可在该处设置关键帧。沿通道拖动关键帧可重新定时。", 'Tip: a Flipbook is drawn one frame after another. Turn on Onion skins to see the frames around the one you are drawing.': "提示：翻页动画是逐帧绘制的。打开洋葱皮可查看正在绘制的帧前后的帧。", 'Tip: draw with the pen, the mouse or a finger. Hold Ctrl and turn the wheel to zoom, and Undo steps back one stroke.': "提示：可用笔、鼠标或手指绘制。按住 Ctrl 并滚动滚轮可缩放；还原会后退一笔。",
  'Edit Style': "编辑样式", 'Pixel perfect': "像素完美", 'Add frame (press and hold, or Alt: add after the hold)': "添加帧（按住，或 Alt：在停留后添加）",
  'A smoother Stage, a second color and tips': "更流畅的舞台、第二种颜色和提示", 'Smooth zoom and pan': "流畅的缩放和平移", 'Zooming and panning the Stage stays smooth on big movies, and playback reuses frames it has already drawn.': "在大型影片上缩放和平移舞台依然流畅，播放时会复用已绘制的帧。", 'Your movie by name': "按名称显示影片", 'The movie name sits in the title bar. Click it to rename the movie.': "影片名称显示在标题栏中。点击即可重命名影片。", 'Copy movies to any folder from the Theater, and see or change where your library lives.': "可从剧场将影片复制到任意文件夹，并查看或更改库的位置。", 'Layers to tracks': "图层转轨道", 'A layered Drawing can turn each of its layers into its own track.': "分层绘图可将每个图层转换为独立的轨道。", 'Secondary color': "背景色", 'Pick a real secondary color, swap the two, and click the previous color to go back.': "可选取真正的背景色，互换两种颜色，并点击上一个颜色返回。", 'Transform several layers': "变换多个图层", 'Select several layers and move, scale or warp them together.': "选择多个图层，可一起移动、缩放或变形。", 'Tips': "提示", 'A short tip shows the first time you open each mode. Turn tips off in Preferences.': "首次打开每种模式时会显示简短提示。可在首选项中关闭提示。",
