  'Show brush folder': "显示画笔文件夹", 'Brush folder': "画笔文件夹", 'The brush folder is not available yet': "画笔文件夹暂不可用", 'Paste and Insert': "粘贴并插入", 'Paste and Insert frames': "粘贴并插入帧", 'The brush library could not be saved to its folder. Trying again.': "无法将画笔库保存到其文件夹。正在重试。", 'Faster playback, smooth dragging and brush folders': "更快的播放、流畅的拖动和画笔文件夹", 'Faster playback': "更快的播放", 'Movies with many sparse drawings play faster from the first pass.': "含有大量稀疏绘图的影片从第一遍起播放更快。", 'Smooth dragging': "流畅的拖动", 'Moving, scaling and turning a block on the Stage stays smooth on big movies.': "在大型影片中，在舞台上移动、缩放和旋转块依然流畅。", 'Quicker video jumps': "更快的视频跳转", 'Jumping far into a long video reaches the exact frame sooner.': "在长视频中大幅跳转时，能更快到达精确的帧。", 'Brush folders': "画笔文件夹", 'Your brush libraries are folders of brush files you can browse. Show brush folder opens them.': "你的画笔库是可浏览的画笔文件文件夹。“显示画笔文件夹”可将其打开。", 'In a Flipbook, Paste and Insert (or Alt with Paste) pushes the later frames along.': "在翻页动画中，“粘贴并插入”（或按住 Alt 粘贴）会将后面的帧向后推。",
